The MIT license above covers Griddy's source code. These parts of the
repository are NOT covered by it and keep their own terms:

- server/data/words-hr.txt: derived from FrequencyWords
  (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, data under CC BY-SA 4.0) and
  filtered with the hunspell hr_HR dictionary
  (https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries). The word list is shared
  under CC BY-SA 4.0; credit both sources when you reuse it.

- client/public/audio/the-tenth-move.*: the "The Tenth Move" music track
  belongs to its rights holder. It is not licensed for reuse.
